{"slug":"m91","name":"M91","description":"M91 is an alert escalation platform that routes critical notifications to the right people through push, SMS, and voice calls until an alert is acknowledged. It supports actionable alerts and sends responders’ actions back to the originating system.","icon":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/QODTxSSZQOvzmE05wWrqVrXTXom_k-wRerP9wNQC5MOOJT01IL7DKh1aqmSAfpoyAF--iBqJpqrgs4YwVRwb4w=w240-h480-rw","domain":"m91-website.app.hostnsoft.com","rank":201,"labels":["IT Operations","Notifications","Phone and SMS"],"categories":["developer-tools","phone-and-sms"],"eventsRead":true,"events":[{"n":"Get Channel Alert by ID","d":"Retrieve a channel alert's status, responders, notes, files, and decision using a Send Alert Link and Alert ID or Custom ID.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Invite Direct Recipient","d":"Invite a person by phone so you can alert them directly once they accept in the M91 app.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Get Direct Alert by ID","d":"Get an alert's status, who answered with notes and files, who is pending, and the decision.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Invite Channel Members","d":"Invite one or more phone numbers to a channel by selecting it or entering its ID. Phones must be digits with country code (no +).","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Create Channel","d":"Create a team alert channel and return its send link, ready for Send Channel Alert.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Send Direct Alert","d":"Send an alert to one phone number with title, description, severity, attachments, callback URL, response buttons, and auto-close.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Send Channel Alert","d":"Send a channel alert using a full send link. Configure title, severity, attachments, responses, custom ID, auto-close.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Close Channel Alert","d":"Close an alert on a chosen channel by selecting Alert ID or Custom ID and providing its value.","t":"action","k":"hook"},{"n":"Delete Direct Recipient","d":"De